 },
 "annotations": {
  "list": []
 },
 "links": [],
 "panels": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "How to read this page",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 4
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "The storefront server's own numbers (service `quicc-storefront`, no SDK: `weborder/src/lib/server/otel/`). Normal: request p95 under about 1 s, upstream (main) p95 under about 500 ms, errors flat, **outbox waiting = 0**. Orders waiting in the outbox mean main did not answer; the oldest age says for how long. Traces: Tempo, service `quicc-storefront`, linked to main's spans through `traceparent`."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Requests per second, by status",
   "description": "Every page and API call the storefront answers (health checks and assets are not counted).",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 4,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "reqps",
     "custom": {
      "lineWidth": 1,
      "fillOpacity": 10
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "legend": {
     "displayMode": "list",
     "placement": "bottom"
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "multi"
    }
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "sum by (status_class) (rate(storefront_request_duration_milliseconds_count{deployment_environment=\"$env\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
     "legendFormat": "{{status_class}}",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Request duration p50 / p95 / p99",
   "description": "Time to answer a customer's request, in the storefront.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 12,
    "y": 4,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "ms",
     "custom": {
      "lineWidth": 1,
      "fillOpacity": 10
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "legend": {
     "displayMode": "list",
     "placement": "bottom"
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "multi"
    }
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(storefront_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{deployment_environment=\"$env\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
     "legendFormat": "p50",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     }
    },
    {
     "refId": "B",
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(storefront_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{deployment_environment=\"$env\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
     "legendFormat": "p95",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     }
    },
    {
     "refId": "C",
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(storefront_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{deployment_environment=\"$env\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
     "legendFormat": "p99",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Request p95 by route",
   "description": "Which page is slow.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 12,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "ms",
     "custom": {
      "lineWidth": 1,
      "fillOpacity": 10
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "legend": {
     "displayMode": "list",
